       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 2400 mg per dose four times daily comes to 9,600 mg/day, three times the maximum daily ibuprofen dose of 3,200 mg (and 2,400 mg is itself above the maximum single dose of 800 mg). That much ibuprofen carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and CNS and metabolic toxicity.\n\nDid you mean a total of 2,400 mg/day? That would be 600 mg by mouth four times daily. Other common regimens are:\n- 400 mg PO every 6 hours (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg PO every 6 hours (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 2400 mg per dose, please confirm that explicitly and give me the clinical rationale for the order note."
